@startuml
title Ambient: the four declared blocks and the three lanes that execute them

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowFontColor #374151
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "**languages/src/ambient.rs** — the declaration" as SPEC #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**types**\n""Proc""   ""Name""\nlines 11-14" as TYPES #DBEAFE
  rectangle "**terms**\n7 constructors\n6 BNFC-style + 1 judgement\nlines 15-28" as TERMS #DCFCE7
  rectangle "**equations**\n6 structural-congruence laws\n5 carry a freshness premise\nlines 35-49" as EQNS #FEF3C7
  rectangle "**rewrites**\n3 capability rules\n+ 3 congruence rules\nlines 50-74" as RWS #FCE7F3
}

rectangle "**target/generated/ambient/** — the emitted implementation" as GEN #FFFFFF {
  rectangle """ast_enums.rs""\n""enum Proc"" (16 variants)\n""enum Name"" (9 variants)" as AST #DBEAFE
  rectangle """parser.rs"" + ""wpda.rs"" + ""display.rs""\nthe surface grammar and its inverse" as PARSER #DCFCE7
  rectangle """binder_congruence.rs""\n""binder_congruence_nf"" —\nthe nu-float normaliser" as FLOAT #FEF3C7
  rectangle """dovetail_report.rs""\n3 ""RewriteRule"" values\n(""InRule"" / ""OutRule"" / ""OpenRule"")" as DOVE #FCE7F3
  rectangle """rho_net_invocation.rs""\nthe in-Rho set-automaton lowering" as RHO #EDE9FE
  rectangle """metadata.rs""\nreflected spec + fingerprint\n""71c57c22672af39e""" as META #F3F4F6
}

TYPES -[#2563EB]-> AST : one enum per sort,\nplus ""PVar"" / ""NVar"" and\nthe HOL plumbing
TERMS -[#16A34A]-> AST : one variant per constructor
TERMS -[#16A34A]-> PARSER : concrete syntax
TERMS -[#16A34A]-> DOVE : constructor op labels

EQNS -[#CA8A04]-> FLOAT : ALL SIX equations are\ndischarged HERE, by construction
EQNS -[#CA8A04]-> RHO : also lowered as\n""StructuralCongruence"" rules
EQNS -[#DC2626,dashed]-> DOVE : **NOTHING** is emitted —\nfreshness premises and binder\npatterns both fail closed

RWS -[#DB2777]-> DOVE : the 3 capability rules\nlower to AC bag patterns
RWS -[#DB2777]-> RHO : ""BaseRewrite"" (capabilities) /\n""ContextualRewrite"" (congruences)
RWS -[#DC2626,dashed]-> DOVE : the 3 congruence rules emit\nnothing — e-graph congruence\nclosure supplies them

SPEC -[#6B7280]-> META : normalised source + fingerprint

note bottom of DOVE #FEE2E2
  The **red dashed** edges are the load-bearing surprise of this
  specification: the Dovetail e-graph receives **three** rules from
  a nine-rule theory. The other six are not lost — they are
  discharged by the float (equations) or intrinsic to the
  e-graph (congruences). See section 9.
end note

@enduml
